# Netflix Content Analysis 📊

## Project Objective
Analyze Netflix's content strategy, geographic expansion, audience targeting, and content freshness using Python.

## Dataset
- Source: Netflix Titles Dataset
- Format: CSV
- Records: XXXX
- Columns: title, type, country, date_added, rating, duration, etc.

## Key Questions Answered
- Movies vs TV Shows trend over time
- Country-wise content growth (India, Korea, UK)
- Genre popularity evolution
- Content freshness & acquisition gap analysis

## Tools Used
- Python (Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, Seaborn)
- VS Code
- GitHub

## Key Insights
- Netflix shifted focus towards TV Shows after 2018
- India and Korea show rapid YoY content growth
- Drama and Comedy dominate globally
- Majority of new content is added within 2 years of release

## Business Impact
These insights help understand Netflix's global expansion, content acquisition strategy, and audience targeting approach.
